      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2319161563375007657ab8c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然间，有一道细光从黑暗中洒落。\n黑色物体开始往光亮的地方走去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e82e365e68bd7e1c8f96de24a6b5d160565e5077bc4fcbe9f56054c04d9c6de0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030704.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:097d0d4f1fc061d76e68b3ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着黑色物体不断前进，光变得越来越强，\n逐渐变成一个耀眼的物体，最后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f92d538fcbe0081766e55fa6b84ec1359ea0af265f09c62d3f51c8440030d1ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030704.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:949e2f44f4aa36f35c3171c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──光线变成了太阳。\n黑暗散去，世界被逐渐照亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71840be882aab8e83081744d1fd7b89746135ef887680b03b8deab4e0ce40184",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1030/storytimeline_501030704.json",
